{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "code-block",
	"title": "Code Block 代码块",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "展示代码、终端输出和 diff，可带标题栏、行号和复制按钮。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"tailwind-variants@^3.3.0"
	],
	"registryDependencies": [
		"scroll-area",
		"use-highlighted-code",
		"button"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"代码块",
				"code block",
				"代码",
				"终端输出",
				"diff",
				"语法高亮"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"展示代码片段、终端输出、日志或 diff",
				"在消息或 trace 中显示工具输出（流式追加时只高亮新行）"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "显示键盘按键或快捷键",
					"use": "kbd"
				},
				{
					"case": "行列结构化数据",
					"use": "table"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"内容区可聚焦，键盘可滚动；浮动操作在获得焦点时也会显示",
				"复制按钮默认名称“复制”／“已复制”，其他语言用 copyLabel、copiedLabel 改",
				"diff 行带 +／− 标记，不只靠颜色；换行切换按钮要设 aria-pressed"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"默认不换行、横向滚动；窄屏可开启 wrap",
				"内容始终从左到右显示，标题栏跟随页面方向"
			],
			"related": [
				"trace",
				"message",
				"kbd"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Code Block 设计规范\n\n- 用于展示代码和命令；行内的短代码用 `<code>`，键盘按键用 Kbd。\n- 代码文本传给 `CodeBlock.Content` 的 `code` 属性，需要行号时设 `lineNumbers`（可配合 `startLine`），长行需要换行时设 `wrap`；不要手写行号。\n- 复制按钮用 `CodeBlock.CopyButton` 并传 `value`；读屏名称和复制后的提示默认是中文（“复制”“已复制”），其他语言用 `copyLabel`、`copiedLabel` 改。\n- 文件名或语言写在 `CodeBlock.Header` 的 `CodeBlock.Title` 中；出错的输出用 `variant=\"destructive\"`，同时在文字中说明错误。\n- 紧凑场景用 `size=\"sm\"`；代码内容固定从左到右排版，不要改 `dir`。\n- Issue 描述与 Agent 回复可分别使用 `appearance=\"issue\"` 和 `appearance=\"agent\"`。它们复用实测的紧凑代码表面、等宽排版和行号留白。语言标签使用 `CodeBlock.Title`，只提供当前界面可用的操作。\n- 内容溢出由 Scroll Area 渲染悬浮滚动条。设置 `max-h-*` 可限制视口高度。需要先裁切再展开时，只在收起状态使用 `scrollOrientation=\"horizontal\"`，避免纵向滚动绕过展开状态。\n- `ref` 指向语义 `pre`，`viewportRef` 指向实际滚动视口。给视口设置清楚的 `aria-label`，并从键盘验证长行、焦点边界和复制反馈。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "code-block/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"code-block-actions\"\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"-my-1 -me-1.5 gap-1 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:m-0 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:top-2 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:end-2 group-data-[size=sm]/code-block:[[data-slot=code-block]>&]:top-1.5 group-data-[size=sm]/code-block:[[data-slot=code-block]>&]:end-1.5 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:*:[button]:bg-background [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:*:[button]:ring-1 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:*:[button]:ring-foreground/10 [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:gap-0 [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:rounded-full [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:border-[0.5px] [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:border-[lch(91.9%_0_282)] [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:bg-white [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:p-0.5 dark:[[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:border-[lch(16.793%_1.93_272)] dark:[[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:bg-[lch(9.232%_.85_272)] [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:*:[button]:bg-transparent [[data-slot=code-block][data-appearance]>&]:*:[button]:ring-0 ms-auto flex shrink-0 items-center [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:absolute [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:z-10 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:opacity-0 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:transition-opacity [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:group-focus-within/code-block:opacity-100 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 [[data-slot=code-block]>&]:pointer-coarse:opacity-100\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "code-block/code-block-actions.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Root as ScrollArea } from \"$UI$/scroll-area/index.js\";\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport CodeBlockLine from \"./code-block-line.svelte\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tviewportRef = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tstyle,\n\t\t\"aria-label\": viewportLabel = \"代码\",\n\t\ttabindex = 0,\n\t\tcode,\n\t\twrap = false,\n\t\tscrollOrientation,\n\t\tlineNumbers = false,\n\t\tstartLine = 1,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLPreElement>> & {\n\t\t/** Plain text to render. Split into lines when `lineNumbers` is set. */\n\t\tcode?: string;\n\t\twrap?: boolean;\n\t\t/** Restricts an axis when the surrounding UI clips rather than scrolls it. */\n\t\tscrollOrientation?: \"horizontal\" | \"vertical\" | \"both\";\n\t\tviewportRef?: HTMLElement | null;\n\t\tlineNumbers?: boolean;\n\t\tstartLine?: number;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\t// A `code` string is split into lines so each one can be numbered.\n\tconst lines = $derived(\n\t\tcode !== undefined && lineNumbers ? code.replace(/\\n$/, \"\").split(\"\\n\") : null\n\t);\n</script>\n\n{#snippet content()}\n\t<code\n\t\tdata-slot=\"code-block-code\"\n\t\tclass=\" grid min-h-lh min-w-max content-start in-data-numbered:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] in-data-wrap:min-w-0\"\n\t>\n\t\t{#if lines}\n\t\t\t{#each lines as line, index (index)}\n\t\t\t\t<CodeBlockLine code={line} />\n\t\t\t{/each}\n\t\t{:else if code !== undefined}\n\t\t\t{code}\n\t\t{:else}\n\t\t\t{@render children?.()}\n\t\t{/if}\n\t</code>\n{/snippet}\n\n<!-- Whitespace inside a <pre> is rendered, so its content is a snippet defined outside it, where Svelte trims whitespace as usual. -->\n<ScrollArea\n\tbind:viewportRef\n\tdata-code-block-scroll-area=\"\"\n\tdir=\"ltr\"\n\ttype=\"hover\"\n\torientation={scrollOrientation ?? (wrap ? \"vertical\" : \"both\")}\n\tviewportLabel={viewportLabel ?? undefined}\n\tviewportProps={{\n\t\ttabindex,\n\t\tstyle,\n\t\t\"data-wrap\": wrap || undefined,\n\t\tclass: cn(\n\t\t\t\"px-3 py-3 leading-relaxed group-has-data-[slot=code-block-header]/code-block:pt-2 group-has-data-[slot=code-block-footer]/code-block:pb-2 group-data-[size=sm]/code-block:px-2.5 group-data-[size=sm]/code-block:py-2.5 group-data-[size=sm]/code-block:group-has-data-[slot=code-block-header]/code-block:pt-1.5 group-data-[appearance]/code-block:py-3 group-data-[appearance]/code-block:ps-0 group-data-[appearance]/code-block:pe-4 group-data-[appearance]/code-block:leading-5 scroll-fade-x h-auto min-h-0 min-w-0 text-start font-mono data-wrap:scroll-fade-y data-wrap:wrap-anywhere\",\n\t\t\tclassName\n\t\t),\n\t}}\n>\n\t<pre\n\t\tbind:this={ref}\n\t\tdata-slot=\"code-block-content\"\n\t\tdata-wrap={wrap || undefined}\n\t\tdata-numbered={lineNumbers || undefined}\n\t\tdir=\"ltr\"\n\t\tstyle:counter-reset=\"line {startLine - 1}\"\n\t\tclass=\"m-0 min-w-0 [font:inherit] data-wrap:whitespace-pre-wrap\"\n\t\t{...restProps}>{@render content()}</pre>\n</ScrollArea>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "code-block/code-block-content.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { onDestroy } from \"svelte\";\n\timport IconPlaceholder from \"$lib/components/icon-placeholder/icon-placeholder.svelte\";\n\timport { Button, type ButtonProps } from \"$UI$/button/index.js\";\n\timport { cn } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tvalue,\n\t\tvariant = \"ghost\",\n\t\tsize = \"icon-xs\",\n\t\tonclick,\n\t\tcopyLabel = \"复制\",\n\t\tcopiedLabel = \"已复制\",\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: Omit<ButtonProps, \"onclick\"> & {\n\t\tvalue: string;\n\t\tonclick?: (e: MouseEvent) => void;\n\t\tcopyLabel?: string;\n\t\tcopiedLabel?: string;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\tlet copied = $state(false);\n\tlet timeout: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;\n\n\tfunction copy() {\n\t\tnavigator.clipboard\n\t\t\t.writeText(value)\n\t\t\t.then(() => {\n\t\t\t\tcopied = true;\n\t\t\t\tclearTimeout(timeout);\n\t\t\t\ttimeout = setTimeout(() => (copied = false), 2000);\n\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t.catch(() => {});\n\t}\n\n\tonDestroy(() => clearTimeout(timeout));\n</script>\n\n<Button\n\tbind:ref\n\tdata-slot=\"code-block-copy-button\"\n\tdata-copied={copied || undefined}\n\t{variant}\n\t{size}\n\taria-label={copied ? copiedLabel : copyLabel}\n\tclass={cn(\"group-data-[appearance]/code-block:size-6.5\", className)}\n\tonclick={(e) => {\n\t\tonclick?.(e);\n\t\tcopy();\n\t}}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{#if copied}\n\t\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\t\tlucide=\"CheckIcon\"\n\t\t\ttabler=\"IconCheck\"\n\t\t\thugeicons=\"Tick02Icon\"\n\t\t\tphosphor=\"CheckIcon\"\n\t\t\tremixicon=\"RiCheckLine\"\n\t\t/>\n\t{:else}\n\t\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\t\tlucide=\"CopyIcon\"\n\t\t\ttabler=\"IconCopy\"\n\t\t\thugeicons=\"Copy01Icon\"\n\t\t\tphosphor=\"CopyIcon\"\n\t\t\tremixicon=\"RiFileCopyLine\"\n\t\t/>\n\t{/if}\n</Button>\n<span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sr-only\">{copied ? copiedLabel : \"\"}</span>\n",
